  "prefLabel": "Mec 201.01 Applicability of Plc 200",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 201.01 Applicability of Plc 200. The Plc 200 rules shall govern the mechanical licensing board with regards to all procedures for:\n\n(a) Adjudicatory proceedings;\n\n(b) Rulemaking submissions, considerations, and disposition of rulemaking petitions;\n\n(c) Public comment hearings;\n\n(d) Declaratory rulings;\n\n(e) All statements of policy and interpretation;\n\n(f) Explanation of adopted rules;\n\n(g) Voluntary surrender of licenses; and\n\n(h) Petitions for waiver of rule.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 200) #13658, eff 6-15-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mec200.html"
